### Feature Client — GET ALL / GET ONE
### JWT + RBAC (desde el ISS-13): requiere el token de un usuario con la concesión
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### GET ALL — solo clientes activos
# @name getAllClients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE — 404 si no existe o está inactivo
# @name getOneClient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 — :id no numérico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
